  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The table shows the power radiated by a point source of light, the intensity detected at a certain location, and the distance between the source and the detector.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Power</th><th>Intensity</th><th>Distance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3P\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.5I\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the value of the distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{6}d\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6d\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{1.5}d\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5d\"></span></p></li></ol>"
